---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/base-layout.astro"
import LegalArticle from "@/components/legal-article.astro"
import PostalAddress from "@/components/postal-address.astro"
import { siteConfig } from "@/lib/config"
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy policy | ${siteConfig.name.public}`}>
  <LegalArticle>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>
      <PostalAddress />
      <br />
      Email:{" "}
      <a class="site-link" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}>
        {siteConfig.contact.email}
      </a>
    </p>

    <h2>Website access and hosting</h2>
    <p>
      This website is hosted by Vercel Inc. When you open a page, technically necessary data is
      processed. This includes your IP address, the time and destination of the request, and browser
      information. Vercel may also process this data in access logs. The website itself does not
      keep a visitor database.
    </p>
    <p>
      This processing makes the website available and secure. Its legal basis is Article 6(1)(f) of
      the GDPR. My legitimate interest is to operate a functional and secure website. Access data is
      processed only for as long as necessary for operation, troubleshooting, and security. The
      exact retention period depends on the hosting settings.
    </p>
    <p>
      Vercel may process data in the United States. Vercel states that it is certified under the
      EU-US Data Privacy Framework. For more information, see{" "}
      <a class="site-link" href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-notice">
        Vercel's privacy notice
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h2>Contact by email</h2>
    <p>
      If you email me, I process your address, the message, and its technical details to respond.
      Depending on the request, the legal basis is Article 6(1)(b) or (f) of the GDPR. I delete the
      correspondence when it is no longer needed for your request, unless legal retention
      obligations apply. There is no contact form.
    </p>

    <h2>Fonts, cookies, and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      The font is served with the website, so loading a page does not connect to the font provider.
      This website does not set its own cookies or use analytics tools, embedded third-party
      content, comments, or newsletters.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, rectification or erasure of, and restriction of processing of your
      personal data. Where the legal requirements are met, you also have a right to data portability
      and may object to processing. Contact me at the email address above to exercise these rights.
      You may also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.
    </p>
  </LegalArticle>
</BaseLayout>
